WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.609
Hadwiger's conjecture, disproved on paper.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.498
These graphs need many colours, yet contain

3
00:00:05.498 --> 00:00:07.795
no tangle as large as Hadwiger promised.

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.263
Random edges, chosen by an algebraic rule, keep every such tangle small.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.260
Claimed: the conjecture fails, even fractionally.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.427
Lean covers only part.
